          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On September 11, 1994, around 11:30 PM, three witnesses in a car observed the fleeting passage of an oval glowing shape. These individuals were specifically \"looking for OVNI.\" However, one of the witnesses is skeptical and believes it was simply the headlight illumination of a vehicle. The theft that same night of material from a nearby construction site could support this theory, but no other information is available.",
